DESCRIPTION:

	image/jpeg --> image/xgw-gstring converter.
	Converts a standard jpeg image into a Geos bitmap.

	$Id: htjpeg.goc,v 1.6.6.1 97/09/05 10:53:06 jeremyb Exp $

